    <list default="true" id="9fd3c5ee-decf-4fcb-8b4d-97c16d2d0217" name="Changes" comment="feat: enhance UI with hover animations and improve request detail navigation&#10;&#10;This commit introduces several UI enhancements and functional improvements:&#10;&#10;- **Hover Animations:** Added hover animations to notification icons and text in both buyer and seller dashboards for improved interactivity. Category selection in the buyer home page and navigation items in the buyer dashboard now also feature hover effects.&#10;- **Request Detail Navigation:** Refactored the `_navigateToDetailScreen` method in `seller_home_dashboard.dart` to correctly parse and display details for different request categories (Vehicle Spares, Tyres &amp; Rims, Consumer Electronics). This includes creating specific navigation helper methods for each category and improving error handling.&#10;- **Data Model Update:** Modified the `RimTyreMoreFields` model to accept `String` instead of `bool` for `fitmentRequired`, `balancingRequired`, and `tyreRotationRequired` fields, aligning with backend data types.&#10;- **Buyer Dashboard Refresh:** Improved the auto-refresh mechanism in the buyer dashboard to avoid showing a loading indicator for background updates, providing a smoother user experience.&#10;- **Mobile View Layout:** Adjusted the layout in `landingMobileController.dart` to use `SingleChildScrollView` to prevent content overflow.&#10;- **Cache Busting:** Implemented cache-busting mechanisms in `web/index.html` and `.htaccess` to ensure users receive the latest version of the application.&#10;- **OTP Screen Text:** Updated placeholder text on the OTP screen to clarify that the code is sent to the user's email address.&#10;- **Main Navigation:** Updated main navigation logic to handle user roles and redirects more effectively.">
